  [1mWhat the change would do:[0m [38;5;153m/admin/reports[39m is the only route in [38;5;153mserver.js[39m returning real data ([38;5;153m{quarter, revenue}[39m);
  [38;5;153m/health[39m and [38;5;153m/reports/public[39m return nothing sensitive. Dropping [38;5;153mrequireLogin[39m makes revenue data readable by any
